  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - In the absence of a legal agreement, the development has failed to secure a nomination agreement with the Council to maximise the utilisation for local residents, and to ensure against the importation of need from outside the Borough, and any necessary monitoring fees and planning services fees. The development would therefore be contrary to adopted Local Plan Policies SC8 and IMP3.",
    "Reason : 2 - The application has failed to demonstrate how the proposal would avoid adverse impacts on the amenity of neighbouring residents through an increase in noise, disturbance and servicing requirements. It is therefore contrary to Local Plan Policies CC2 and EQ5.",
    "Reason : 3 - The proposal has failed to demonstrate that it would not result in increased parking stress or prejudice highway safety, contrary to Local Plan Policy EC2."
  ],
